# Copy this to .env for local development. Leaving it unset is also
# fine locally — Vite's dev-server proxy (vite.config.js) forwards
# /api and /uploads to http://127.0.0.1:8000 automatically, so
# VITE_API_URL only needs to be set for a production build.

# On Vercel, set this in Project Settings → Environment Variables to
# your deployed Render backend's URL (no trailing slash, no /api suffix
# — that's added automatically):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-chithramaya-backend.onrender.com
